                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Great game, great mystery, great story, lovely characters, interesting protagonist and cool use of character customization and stats.\nI only have one problem which is the fact that [spoiler] the three main characters that you can interact with or even potentially romance can only be chosen individually. If you don't pursue their storyline or even skip the first game in the Evertree series alltogether, you will never see these characters again which is kind of a shame. [/spoiler]\n",
